<title>USA: Bank of L.A., American West merger OK'd.</title>
<headline>Bank of L.A., American West merger OK'd.</headline>
<dateline>WEST HOLLYWOOD, Calif. 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Los Angeles said its shareholders approved the merger with American West Bank at a special meeting held on February 16.</p>
<p>The agreement calls for Bank of Los Angeles to issue one share of common stock for each outstanding share of American West. The merger will result in a combined bank with assets of $190 million.</p>
<p>Bank of Los Angeles said it expects to complete the merger on March 31.</p>
</text>
